Source: nodal
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Maintainer: No-dal <dev@no-dal.com>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13), golang-go
Standards-Version: 4.7.0
Homepage: https://no-dal.com
Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: nodal
Architecture: amd64
Depends: ndl-control, ndl-agent, ndl-ui, nodalctl
Suggests: nodal-feature-oci, nodal-feature-gpu, nodal-feature-k8s, nodal-feature-distributed-storage, nodal-feature-ai
Description: No-dal Community Edition metapackage
 Pulls in the control plane, node agent, web UI, and CLI.
 Phase 1 first-boot install. Core packages only.
 GPU, Kubernetes, distributed storage, and AI stay optional feature packages.

Package: ndl-control
Architecture: amd64
Depends: postgresql-16 | postgresql, adduser, ${misc:Depends}
Description: No-dal unprivileged control plane
 HTTP API, TLS settings, and static UI host. Must not run as root.
 Prepares local PostgreSQL 16 and the ndl-control service user.

Package: ndl-agent
Architecture: amd64
Depends: adduser, qemu-utils, qemu-system-x86, dnsmasq-base, nftables, lxc, lxcfs, uidmap, gpgv, iproute2, ${misc:Depends}
Recommends: ovmf
Suggests: lvm2, nfs-common, cifs-utils, open-iscsi, wireguard-tools
Description: No-dal privileged node agent
 Typed host operations only. No generic command execution.
 Phase 5 adds liblxc system containers started by nodal-ct@.service.

Package: ndl-ui
Architecture: all
Depends: ndl-control, ${misc:Depends}
Description: No-dal web UI static files
 Served by ndl-control. Not a standalone Node process.

Package: nodalctl
Architecture: amd64
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Description: No-dal command-line client
 Uses the same supported API as the web UI.
 Core package only.

Package: ndl-guest
Architecture: amd64
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Description: No-dal Guest Agent for Linux VMs
 Optional in-guest daemon for Files and PTY over org.nodal.guest.0.
 Not required to create or start a VM. Not a host package dependency.

Package: nodal-feature-oci
Architecture: all
Depends: ndl-agent, ${misc:Depends}
Suggests: containerd
Description: Optional OCI extras for No-dal
 Not a Phase 1 dependency. Enable with nodalctl feature enable oci.
 Does not add containerd to the nodal metapackage.

Package: nodal-feature-gpu
Architecture: all
Depends: ndl-agent, ${misc:Depends}
Suggests: nvidia-driver, nvidia-container-toolkit
Description: Optional GPU services package set for No-dal
 Not a Phase 1 dependency. Enable with nodalctl feature enable gpu.
 Does not install NVIDIA drivers until the operator enables this package.

Package: nodal-feature-k8s
Architecture: all
Depends: ndl-agent, ${misc:Depends}
Suggests: kubeadm, kubelet
Description: Optional Kubernetes package set for No-dal
 Not a Phase 1 dependency. Enable with nodalctl feature enable k8s.
 Does not start kubelet. Kubernetes runtime is a later optional phase.

Package: nodal-feature-distributed-storage
Architecture: all
Depends: ndl-agent, ${misc:Depends}
Suggests: ceph
Description: Optional distributed storage package set for No-dal
 Not a Phase 1 dependency. Enable with nodalctl feature enable distributed_storage.
 Does not start Ceph.

Package: nodal-feature-ai
Architecture: all
Depends: ndl-agent, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Optional AI services package set for No-dal
 Not a Phase 1 dependency. Enable with nodalctl feature enable ai.
 Does not start model runtimes.

